  "details": "UTMStack before 11.2.16 contains a JPQL injection vulnerability that allows authenticated attackers to read arbitrary entity data by exploiting UtmNetworkScanService.searchPropertyValues(), which builds a JPQL query with String.format() and executes it via em.createQuery() without parameter binding. Attackers can inject malicious JPQL through the value parameter in the GET /api/utm-network-scans/searchPropertyValues endpoint to extract sensitive data including credential tables such as jhi_user.",
